{"output":"I’ll locate the search code and tests, add protection against stale requests, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller allowed every completed request to update state. I added a request counter that also advances when the query is cleared, so stale requests cannot update results, errors, or loading. I’ll run the existing tests and a direct race-condition check.\n\nUpdated src/search/controller.ts to ignore stale request results, errors, and loading updates. Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; inline race-condition checks passed; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Updated src/search/controller.ts to ignore stale request results, errors, and loading updates. Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; inline race-condition checks passed; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":10,"tool_calls":[{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short; cat package.json","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/4-1-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":379,"stdout_bytes":179,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-d0ed45d1483e0f52ab2fd197e528ff42.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test && node --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst items = [{ id: '1', title: 'Latest', url: '/' }];\nfor (const staleFails of [false, true]) {\n  for (const clear of [false, true]) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const old = c.search('old');\n    const latest = c.search(clear ? '  ' : 'new');\n    const expected = c.getState();\n    if (staleFails) requests[0].reject(new Error('Stale failure'));\n    else requests[0].resolve(items);\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), expected);\n    if (!clear) requests[1].resolve(items);\n    await latest;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: clear ? '' : 'new', results: clear ? [] : items, loading: false, error: null });\n  }\n}\nconst requests = [];\nconst c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise(resolve => requests.push(resolve)) });\nconst old = c.search('old');\nconst latest = c.search('new');\nrequests[1](items);\nawait latest;\nrequests[0]([]);\nawait old;\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState().results, items);\nconsole.log('Race-condition checks passed');\nNODE\n git diff --check; git diff --stat","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/4-1-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":359,"stdout_bytes":551,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-9521f42b76063f000d4104c6303138eb.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":54646,"output_tokens":1016}}
